# ...except ours, which is hand-written and part of the build.
!winnotix.spec

# Local snapshots of the upstream playlist repositories, used only to
# regenerate the catalogues in resources/. The catalogues are committed; the
# snapshots are not, since Winnotix always fetches playlists live.
IPTVrepo/
newIPTVrepo/

# Terminal captures kept while testing a stream. Useful for a session, quoted
# into a commit or the changelog when they prove something, and not worth
# carrying afterwards.
Terminal Logs.md
